WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.510
Killshot. An online shooter for up to eight players.

2
00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:11.140
Three hand-authored maps. Eight weapons. Five hit points.

3
00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:16.840
You spawn with a sidearm. The rest you take from the blocks overhead.

4
00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:21.500
Slide, sprint, and kick between the walls.

5
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:35.500
Version 31 adds the Breach-12. Six shells, eight pellets each.

6
00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:39.670
Killshot. It runs in your browser.
